{"id": "reczz28MLgJayHOi", "order": 2, "images": ["/media/d8bcd7e1c32994681303c2f4.jpg", "/media/200e0be1a5fc1632ffc2379f.jpg", "/media/cfe6b526a5211dbce6f1db95.jpg", "/media/122756061afea8db5b9e757c.jpg", "/media/cf67a8ea3da5136ae6c7e4bd.jpg", "/media/e896a4497d1a4377ff844121.jpg", "/media/e43ad52c4dd70aa9804ca25c.jpg", "/media/7333d977891e42cd11e100e3.jpg", "/media/b89887859c2fe055fc58e7d8.jpg", "/media/f13116f783a39c4d64759bdd.jpg", "/media/558ea7bed5383cf011c8a47d.jpg"], "name": "Illustrated People｜皮肤上的照片", "originalName": "Illustrated People", "termName": "盛夏", "author": "Thomas Mailaender", "year": "2013", "medium": "实验摄影／身体艺术", "collection": "RVB Books；涉及23张原始底片", "caption": "", "why": "有些夏天的记忆，是直接烙在皮肤上的。", "whyLong": "他把档案底片贴在模特的皮肤上，用强力紫外线灯曝光，留下仿佛晒伤般的红色影像，再在痕迹消退前将它拍下。夏日晒痕变成了短暂的身体摄影。\n\n想想冰镇汽水瓶表面的水珠、泳池边冰凉的瓷砖——盛夏最强烈的感受，常常不是炎热本身，而是炎热在身体上留下的痕迹。晒痕会褪，烟火会灭，这组作品把那种「正在消失的夏天」印在了皮肤上。", "scene": "", "detail": "", "method": "", "twist": "", "absence": "", "extra": "", "official": "https://rvb-books.com/products/thomas-mailaender-illustrated-people"}